  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added quadratic, cubic, and arbitrary-degree Bezier curve primitives; TrueType text layout and GeometryScene text layers; generic grid abstractions; bounds- and pixel-density-based spatial raster grid construction; typed curve, contour, region, signed-distance, and collection rasterization overloads; 8-bit and 16-bit grayscale color types; and curve stroke rasterization. Breaking changes include replacing RasterGrid with SpatialRasterGrid, separating non-spatial Raster<T> from SpatialRaster<T>, changing rasterizer contracts to return spatial rasters, regrouping rasterizer types and extensions by source type, replacing primitive grayscale raster values with Gray8BitColor and Gray16BitColor, and removing tolerance from containment classification. Improved Bezier projection, contour and region enclosure, and text rasterization performance. Expanded vector, curve, contour, region, rasterization, text, snapshot, fuzz, stress, benchmark, and documentation coverage.",
